DESC:Daggerheart is a fantasy tabletop roleplaying game of brave heroics and vibrant worlds. Powered by the dual-d12 Hope and Fear engine, players forge rich characters shaped by unique ancestries and communities, collaborating with the Game Master to weave deeply narrative, action-packed adventures across perilous realms.

